    "description": "Vintage Hull Wildflower Art Pottery  3-Piece Lot\n\nStunning 3-piece lot of vintage USA art pottery featuring Hull’s popular Wildflower pattern. This beautifully matched grouping showcases classic pastel matte glaze shading in soft pinks, yellows, blues, and mint green, accented by raised floral appliqus.\n\nLot Details & Measurements\n\n* Double Trumpet / Console Vase: 8.5” tall. Marked on bottom: Hull W15-8” U.S.A.\n* Two-Handled Urn Vase: 6.5” tall. Marked on bottom: Hull USA A-6-6”\n* Small Two-Handled Vase: 4.5” tall. Marked on bottom: Hull USA 403-4”\n\nCondition\nExcellent vintage condition with crisp mold details and beautiful coloration. Free of major chips or cracks. Light, expected crazing is present and consistent with age and authentic art pottery manufacturing. Please review all photos carefully for the exact condition and details of each piece.",
